WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:01.768 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers
And this is "Late Night."

00:00:01.768 --> 00:00:03.203 align:start size:94% position:6%
We hope you're all
doing well tonight.

00:00:03.203 --> 00:00:04.104 size:81% position:41% line:92%
Let's get to the news.

00:00:04.104 --> 00:00:06.006 line:92%
Former President Trump's frien

00:00:06.006 --> 00:00:09.075 align:start size:94% position:6%
and chair of
his 2017 inaugural fund,

00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:10.910 align:start size:94% position:6%
Tom Barrack,
was arrested yesterday

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:13.279 size:84% position:42%
on charges of violating
foreign lobbying laws,

00:00:13.279 --> 00:00:16.082 align:start size:94% position:6%
obstructing justice,
and making false statements,

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:20.787 align:start size:94% position:6%
as well as one count of
impersonating an astronaut

00:00:20.787 --> 00:00:22.088 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
That's right.

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:24.124 align:start size:94% position:6%
Another of Trump's friends
was arrested yesterday.

00:00:24.124 --> 00:00:27.560
Okay, it's no longer news when
a friend of Trump's is arrested.

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:32.065 align:start size:94% position:6%
The only possibly interestin
thing now is, what for?

00:00:32.065 --> 00:00:34.968 align:start size:94% position:6%
Regicide?
I didn't see that coming.

00:00:34.968 --> 00:00:38.104
The White House reportedly
held high-level discussion

00:00:38.104 --> 00:00:39.172 size:81% position:41% line:92%
recently with Fox News

00:00:39.172 --> 00:00:41.341 align:start size:94% position:6%
over its coronavirus vaccine
coverage.

00:00:41.341 --> 00:00:42.642 line:92%
Yeah, well, good luck with that.

00:00:42.642 --> 00:00:44.477 size:75% position:38%
You might be able to
talk some sense into

00:00:44.477 --> 00:00:45.779 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Fox &amp; Friends"
or Bret Baier,

00:00:45.779 --> 00:00:49.682
but once Fox News after dark
starts, it's the wild West

00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:52.685
Tucker Carlson will tell you
the vaccines are dangerous

00:00:52.685 --> 00:00:54.754 line:92%
while getting the vaccine.

00:00:54.754 --> 00:00:57.257
The Pentagon's inspector general
announced plans this week

00:00:57.257 --> 00:01:01.294
to review procedures to keep
the so-called nuclear football

00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:02.996 size:81% position:41% line:92%
secure during a crisis

00:01:02.996 --> 00:01:05.765 align:start size:94% position:6%
in the event
that it is lost or stolen

00:01:05.765 --> 00:01:08.134 line:92%
or ends up in the wrong mouth.

00:01:08.134 --> 00:01:10.203 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"Major, drop it!

00:01:10.203 --> 00:01:12.405 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It's not a toy."

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:13.973 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.973 --> 00:01:16.943 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I'll talk to him.
I'll talk to him."

00:01:18.344 --> 00:01:19.846 line:92%
A bipartisan group of Senators

00:01:19.846 --> 00:01:22.348 align:start size:94% position:6%
working on finalizing
the infrastructure framework

00:01:22.348 --> 00:01:25.819 align:start size:94% position:6%
reportedly met last night
over tacos and wine.

00:01:25.819 --> 00:01:27.821 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I'm not sure
there's a better metaphor

00:01:27.821 --> 00:01:30.924 align:start size:94% position:6%
for the state of bipartisanshi
in Washington

00:01:30.924 --> 00:01:32.892 align:start size:94% position:6%
than having wine
with your tacos.

00:01:32.892 --> 00:01:36.830
What happened? The Republicans
filibustered the margaritas?

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:39.432 align:start size:94% position:6%
Tampa Bay Buccaneers'
star quarterback Tom Brady

00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:40.733 align:start size:94% position:6%
Visited the White House
yesterday

00:01:40.733 --> 00:01:42.602 align:start size:94% position:6%
to celebrate the team's
Super Bowl win

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:43.837 line:92%
and apparently brought jokes

00:01:43.837 --> 00:01:47.774
-Not a lot of people, you know
think that we could have won

00:01:47.774 --> 00:01:50.777 size:84% position:42%
And, in fact, I think
about 40% of the people

00:01:50.777 --> 00:01:51.978 line:92%
still don't think we won.

00:01:51.978 --> 00:01:55.048 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I understand that.
-Do you understand that,
Mr. President?

00:01:55.048 --> 00:01:56.950 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, Trump's not
gonna like that.

00:01:56.950 --> 00:01:58.184 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
He loved you!

00:01:58.184 --> 00:01:59.619 line:92%
Dude, but I say, "Lean into it."

00:01:59.619 --> 00:02:02.188 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Hey, uh, what's the differenc
between football

00:02:02.188 --> 00:02:02.722 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
and Donald Trump?

00:02:02.722 --> 00:02:05.792
Football's got a fourth quarter.
The man's broke."

00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:09.195 size:78% position:39% line:92%
What else? What else?

00:02:09.195 --> 00:02:11.564 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.564 --> 00:02:14.601 line:92%
It's hard doing them standing.

00:02:14.601 --> 00:02:16.469 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.469 --> 00:02:19.906 align:start size:94% position:6%
In a recent interview,
a top aide to President Bide

00:02:19.906 --> 00:02:22.041 size:84% position:42%
said that engaging with
former President Trump

00:02:22.041 --> 00:02:24.144 align:start size:94% position:6%
is like, quote,
"wrestling with an alligator."

00:02:24.144 --> 00:02:27.280 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then again, at Biden's age
putting on a sweater

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:29.949 align:start size:94% position:6%
is like wrestling
with an alligator.

00:02:29.949 --> 00:02:31.851 align:start size:94% position:6%
And finally,
amid growing concerns

00:02:31.851 --> 00:02:35.221
of contracting coronavirus
in Tokyo's Olympic Village

00:02:35.221 --> 00:02:36.890 line:92%
the U.S. women's gymnastics team

00:02:36.890 --> 00:02:38.892 align:start size:94% position:6%
yesterday decided
to move in to a hotel.

00:02:38.892 --> 00:02:41.427 align:start size:94% position:6%
And get this -- In addition to
everything else she can do

00:02:41.427 --> 00:02:44.731 size:88% position:44%
Simone Biles figured out
